## 3. Recommended Maintenance Adjustments

1. **Build Script Flag Toggle (`scripts/build.py`)**:
   - Add CLI parameter `--windowed` / `--console` to `scripts/build.py` so distribution release builds can target `--windowed` GUI mode while dev/CI test builds default to `--console` mode.
2. **Traceback Clipboard Sanitization (`src/ui/dialogs.py`)**:
   - Apply privacy redaction filter to exception traceback string before copying to clipboard in `ErrorDialog`.
3. **Icon Match Refactoring (`src/ui/icons.py`)**:
   - Split `_create_vector_icon` match cases into sub-helper functions (`_draw_window_controls`, `_draw_nav_icons`, `_draw_dialog_icons`) in a future code quality cleanup.

